.DS_Store
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.log
.vercel

# ── Native wrappers (Capacitor) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# The ios/ and android/ PROJECTS are committed deliberately — they hold real
# configuration (bundle id, display name, permissions, icons) that would be lost
# and silently regenerated with defaults if they were ignored. Only the machine-
# generated build output below is excluded.
#
# The exception is each project's copy of the web build: `npx cap sync` copies
# dist/ into them, so committing it would put a second, staler copy of the whole
# app in the repository — and dist/ itself is already ignored above.
ios/App/App/public/
android/app/src/main/assets/public/

# Local machine paths — points at THIS Mac's SDK, wrong on every other machine.
android/local.properties

# Build output and caches.
ios/App/build/
ios/App/Pods/
ios/App/output/
ios/App/App.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
ios/App/App.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
ios/DerivedData/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/
android/captures/
android/.idea/
*.apk
*.aab
